Here is a self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Taito arcade game "Asteroids" as a single, playable web page. It includes the vector-style graphics, authentic rules, and the iconic gameplay loop.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>1978 Taito Arcade - Asteroids</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #0a0a0a;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .cabinet {
      background: #1a1a1a;
      border: 4px solid #444;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 100, 0, 0.3);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .marquee {
      background: #222;
      color: #f80;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      padding: 10px 40px;
      border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #f80;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #f80;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .screen-wrapper {
      background: #000;
      border: 6px solid #333;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 10px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #000, 0 0 20px #f80;
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      background: #0f0f0f;
      width: 800px;
      height: 600px;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: #ccc;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      background: #111;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 2px solid #444;
    }
    .controls span {
      background: #222;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #f80;
      color: #f80;
    }
    .btn-panel {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .btn {
      background: #222;
      color: #f80;
      border: 2px solid #f80;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.1s;
    }
    .btn:active {
      background: #f80;
      color: #000;
      transform: scale(0.95);
    }
    .status {
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cabinet">
  <div class="marquee">★ ASTEROIDS ★</div>
  <div class="screen-wrapper">
    <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="800" height="600"></canvas>
  </div>
  <div class="controls">
    <div><span>⬅️ ROTATE</span> <span>➡️ ROTATE</span> <span>⬆️ THRUST</span> <span>💥 FIRE</span></div>
    <div style="color:#f80;">SCORE: <span id="scoreDisplay">0</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="btn-panel">
    <button class="btn" id="resetBtn">↺ RESET</button>
    <button class="btn" id="hyperspaceBtn">🌀 HYPERSPACE</button>
  </div>
  <div class
